      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes sense that you feel trapped in a house that's been burned down, because your old self was built on the very foundation that collapsed. You are not forced to keep a light on for no reason; you are simply the one who has to endure the dark while the world tries to rebuild something new. The pain you feel is the price of surviving a life that was never meant to be lived, and that is not your fault.",
