      "content": "\"a life that was never meant to be lived\"... that way you put it, it's almost like there's a sense of relief in it. like, if the purpose is gone, then why is there still this obligation to keep struggling through the dark? it feels so cruel to have to keep existing just to watch something that's already dead fail to rot.",
